_mention_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0035","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001","surface":"太學博士","start":31,"end":35}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-017","source_id":"s-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple-ws1748380","chapter_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001","quote":"大明七年正月庚子，有司奏：「故宣貴妃加殊禮，未詳應立廟與不？」太學博士虞龢議：「曲禮云：『天子有后，有夫人。』檀弓云：『舜葬蒼梧，三妃未之從。』昏義云：『后之立六宮，有三夫人。』然則三妃即三夫人也。后之有三妃，猶天子之有三公也。按周禮，三公八命，諸侯七命。三公既尊於列國諸侯，三妃亦貴於庶邦夫人。據春秋傳，仲子非魯惠元嫡，尚得考彼別宮。今貴妃是秩，天之崇班，理應立此新廟。」左丞徐爰議：「宣貴妃既加殊命，禮絕五宮，考之古典，顯有成據。廟堂克構，宜選將作大匠。」參詳以龢、爰議為允。詔可。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0035"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-nanshi011-yinshuyi-r2-110","person_id":"i7o_va4_pbj","title":"太學博士","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","attestations":[{"id":"th-nanshi011-yinshuyi-r2-110:a","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p002:m0114","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null,"paragraph_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p002","surface":"太學博士","start":110,"end":114}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-017","source_id":"s-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple-ws1748380","chapter_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p002","quote":"大明七年三月戊戌，有司奏：「新安王服宣貴妃齊衰朞，十一月練，十三月縞，十五月祥，心喪三年。未詳宣貴妃祔廟，應在何時？入廟之日，當先有祔，為但入新廟而已？若在大祥及禫中入廟者，遇四時便得祭不？新安王在心制中，得親奉祭不？」太學博士虞龢議：「春秋傳云：『祔而作主，烝嘗禘於廟。』嘗為吉祭之名，大祥及禫，未得入廟，應在禫除之後也。新安王心喪之內，若遇時節，便應吉祭於廟，親奉亦在無嫌。祔之為言，以後亡者祔於先廟也。小記云：『諸侯不得祔於天子。』今貴妃爵視諸侯，居然不得祔於先后。又別考新宮，無所宜祔。且卒哭之後，益無祔理。」左丞徐爰議以：「禮有損益，古今異儀，雖云卒哭而祔，祔而作主，時之諸侯，皆禫終入廟。且麻衣縓緣，革服於元嘉，苫絰變除，申情於皇宋。況宣貴妃誕育叡蕃，葬加殊禮，靈筵廬位，皆主之哲王，考宮創祀，不得關之朝廷。謂禫除之後，宜親執奠爵之禮。若有故，三卿行事。貴妃上厭皇姑，下絕列國，無所應祔。」參議，龢議大體與爰不異，宜以爰議為允。詔可。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p002:m0114"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005","text":"出爲冠軍將軍、吳郡太守，遷中領軍。坐在郡用朝舍錢三十六萬營餉二宮諸王及作絳襖奉獻軍用，左遷光祿大夫，尋加太常及金紫，加散騎常侍。廷尉虞龢議社稷合爲一神，琨案舊糾駮。時龢深被親寵，朝廷多琨強正。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":21,"last_line":21,"raw_start":857,"raw_end":953,"raw_character_offsets":[857,858,859,860,861,862,863,864,865,866,867,868,869,870,871,872,873,874,875,876,877,878,879,880,881,882,883,884,885,886,887,888,889,890,891,892,893,894,895,896,897,898,899,900,901,902,903,904,905,906,907,908,909,910,911,912,913,914,915,916,917,918,919,920,921,922,923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942,943,944,945,946,947,948,949,950,951,952],"revision_id":1513918},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005:m0066","start":66,"end":68,"surface":"虞龢","kind":"person","person_id":"i7o_va4_pbj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005:m0083","start":83,"end":84,"surface":"龢","kind":"person","person_id":"i7o_va4_pbj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro:p005:m0092","start":92,"end":93,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro","book_id":"b-nanqishu-032","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-032-wangkun-family-intro-ws1513918"},{"id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005","text":"初，琨從兄華孫長襲華爵新建縣侯，嗜酒多愆失，琨表以長將傾基緒，請以長小弟佟嗣焉。琨後出為吳郡太守，遷中領軍，坐在郡用朝舍錢三十六萬，營餉二宮諸王及作絳襖奉獻軍用，左遷光祿大夫。尋加太常及金紫，加散騎常侍。廷尉虞和議社稷各一神，琨案舊糾駁，不為屈。時和見寵，朝廷歎琨強正。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":2,"end":3,"surface":"琨","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0002","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作琨。"},{"start":5,"end":6,"surface":"華","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0005","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作華。"},{"start":7,"end":8,"surface":"長","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0007","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作長。"},{"start":9,"end":10,"surface":"華","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0009","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFAB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作華。"},{"start":22,"end":23,"surface":"琨","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0022","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFBA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作琨。"},{"start":25,"end":26,"surface":"長","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0025","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作長。"},{"start":33,"end":34,"surface":"長","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0033","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAFABAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作長。"},{"start":36,"end":37,"surface":"佟","id":"c-nanshi-023-wangkun:p005:m0036","person_id":"02c_86e_5a9","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作佟。"},{"start":40,"end":41,